# Reader Context

This file personalizes your knowledge extractions. Every source you add is framed through YOUR context — your role, domains, and goals. Two people reading the same article get different extracts.

Edit this file to match who you are and what you care about. Bump `synced:` (frontmatter) whenever you refresh your goals — extracts flag your framing as stale if it drifts far behind today.

